        "block_type": "blockquote",
        "tag": "blockquote",
        "text": "Mayo Clinic, Sex Education: Talking to Toddlers and Preschoolers about Sex , July 2016. American Academy of Pediatrics, Healthychildren.org, Sexual Behaviors in Young Children: What’s Normal, What’s Not , July 2016. Nemours, KidsHealth, Sleepwalking , August 2018. American Academy of Family Physicians, Familydoctor.org, Talking to Your Kids About Sex , January 2017. Nemours, KidsHealth, Questions and Answers About Sex , August 2014. What to Expect the Second Year , Heidi Murkoff and Sharon Mazel. Whattoexpect.com, Toddler Sleep Walking and Sleep-Talking , December 2018.",
        "text_sha256": "1d50f76970162b826720f6e782a8e58c6584e8dc17b63c5b56da0df0056ed11d",
